ogo-img"/></div><div class="logo-slider_logo"><img sizes="100vw" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/649d808ba8385965c74d94df/672a422e67d43e2b529b6db4_Databricks-p-500.png 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/649d808ba8385965c74d94df/672a422e67d43e2b529b6db4_Databricks.png 556w" alt="" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/649d808ba8385965c74d94df/672a422e67d43e2b529b6db4_Databricks.png" loading="lazy" class="logo-slider_logo-img"/></div><div class="logo-slider_logo"><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/649d808ba8385965c74d94df/672a422d94478cc5e89e041c_Northrop.png" alt="" class="logo-slider_logo-img"/></div><div class="logo-slider_logo is-booz"><div class="logo-slider_info"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" class="logo-slider_info-icon"><path d="M12 17C12.2833 17 12.521 16.904 12.713 16.712C12.905 16.52 13.0007 16.2827 13 16V12C13 11.7167 12.904 11.4793 12.712 11.288C12.52 11.0967 12.2827 11.0007 12 11C11.7173 10.9993 11.48 11.0953 11.288 11.288C11.096 11.4807 11 11.718 11 12V16C11 16.2833 11.096 16.521 11.288 16.713C11.48 16.905 11.7173 17.0007 12 17ZM12 9C12.2833 9 12.521 8.904 12.713 8.712C12.905 8.52 13.0007 8.28267 13 8C12.9993 7.71733 12.9033 7.48 12.712 7.288C12.5207 7.096 12.2833 7 12 7C11.7167 7 11.4793 7.096 11.288 7.288C11.0967 7.48 11.0007 7.71733 11 8C10.9993 8.28267 11.0953 8.52033 11.288 8.713C11.4807 8.90567 11.718 9.00133 12 9ZM12 22C10.6167 22 9.31667 21.7373 8.1 21.212C6.88334 20.6867 5.825 19.9743 4.925 19.075C4.025 18.1757 3.31267 17.1173 2.788 15.9C2.26333 14.6827 2.00067 13.3827 2 12C1.99933 10.6173 2.262 9.31733 2.788 8.1C3.314 6.88267 4.02633 5.82433 4.925 4.925C5.82367 4.02567 6.882 3.31333 8.1 2.788C9.318 2.26267 10.618 2 12 2C13.382 2 14.682 2.26267 15.9 2.788C17.118 3.31333 18.1763 4.02567 19.075 4.925C19.9737 5.82433 20.6863 6.88267 21.213 8.1C21.7397 9.31733 22.002 10.6173 22 12C21.998 13.3827 21.7353 14.6827 21.212 15.9C20.6887 17.1173 19.9763 18.1757 19.075 19.075C18.1737 19.9743 17.1153 20.687 15.9 21.213C14.6847 21.739 13.3847 22.0013 12 22ZM12 20C14.2333 20 16.125 19.225 17.675 17.675C19.225 16.125 20 14.2333 20 12C20 9.76667 19.225 7.875 17.675 6.325C16.125 4.775 14.2333 4 12 4C9.76667 4 7.875 4.775 6.325 6.325C4.775 7.875 4 9.76667 4 12C4 14.2333 4.775 16.125 6.325 17.675C7.875 19.225 9.76667 20 12 20Z" fill="black"></path></svg></div><a href="/webinar/accelerating-ai-governance-maturity-from-principles-into-practice-spotlight-ai-driven-pharma-in-2030" class="logo-slider_case-study-tag">View Case Study</a><img sizes="100vw" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/649d808ba8385965c74d94df/6a9a374bd5bbe33f508d0ca8_madrigal-pharmaceuticals-logo-p-500.png 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/649d808ba8385965c74d94df/6a9a374bd5bbe33f508d0ca8_madrigal-pharmaceuticals-logo.png 770w" alt="" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/649d808ba8385965c74d94df/6a9a374bd5bbe33f508d0ca8_madrigal-pharmaceuticals-logo.png" loading="lazy" class="logo-slider_logo-img"/></div></div></div></div><div class="home-challenge n-section"><div class="n-container"><div class="section-head"><div class="section-chip is-parakeet-white">The Challenge</div><h2 class="n-section-title">AI is Scaling Faster Than You Can Govern It.<br/>Agents Just Made It Autonomous.</h2><p class="section-subtitle">Enterprises are deploying agents, models, and applications at unprecedented speed – and agents now act autonomously, in milliseconds, thousands of times an hour. Governance is still manual, fragmented, and stuck in spreadsheets. You cannot govern a system that acts in milliseconds with a monthly audit. </p></div><div class="div-block-278"><div class="div-block-279"><div class="div-block-280"><div class="text-block-60">60%</div><div>of enterprise<br/>are scaling AI</div></div><div class="div-block-281"></div><div class="div-block-280 is-alt"><div>Only</div><div class="text-block-60 is-gradient">4%</div><div>are governing it.</div></div></div><a href="https://www.credo.ai/downloadsopen/the-state-of-ai-governance" target="_blank" class="text-block-61">Credo AI: State of AI Governance 2026 Report</a></div></div></div><div class="home-standard n-section"><div class="n-container is-side-by-side"><div class="home-standardad_content"><div class="section-head is-left-align"><div class="section-chip">The Standard for Trusted AI</div><h2 class="n-section-title">Defining AI Governance Since 2020. Now Defining Agent Governance.</h2><p class="section-subtitle">Credo AI pioneered contextual, continuous, comprehensive AI governance and is now defining Agent Governance: registry for every agent, purpose-built agentic risk and controls, and governance. For agents, models, and applications with policy packs containing regulatory intelligence for every major AI standard, policy and regulation, integrated with the systems you already use.</p></div><div class="home-standard_supported-systems"><div class="n-text-size-tiny opacity-50">Supports all Systems</div><div class="buttons-wrapper is-supported-systems"><div class="n-button is-systems"><div class="n-button_icon is-20p"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none"><mask id="path-1-inside-1_522_1097" fill="white"><rect x="3.33398" y="5.83203" width="13.3333" height="11.6667" rx="0.833333"></rect></mask><rect x="3.33398" y="5.83203" width="13.3333" height="11.6667" rx="0.833333" stroke="#F4F2F3" stroke-width="2" mask="url(#path-1-inside-1_522_1097)"></rect><rect x="-0.5" y="0.5" width="2.33333" height="3.16667" rx="1.16667" transform="matrix(-1 0 0 1 18.166 9.16797)" stroke="#F4F2F3"></rect><path d="M13.166 12.333H11.833V11H13.166V12.333ZM10.833 12.5C10.833 12.9316 11.1607 13.2865 11.5811 13.3291L11.666 13.333H13.333C13.7644 13.3328 14.1196 13.0052 14.1621 12.585L14.166 12.5V10.833C14.1658 10.373 13.793 10.0002 13.333 10H11.666C11.2059 10 10.8332 10.3729 10.833 10.833V12.5Z" fill="#F4F2F3"></path><path d="M8.16602 12.333H6.83301V11H8.16602V12.333ZM5.83301 12.5C5.83301 12.9316 6.16072 13.2865 6.58105 13.3291L6.66602 13.333H8.33301C8.76443 13.3328 9.11957 13.0052 9.16211 12.585L9.16602 12.5V10.833C9.16584 10.373 8.79299 10.0002 8.33301 10H6.66602C6.20589 10 5.83318 10.3729 5.83301 10.833V12.5Z" fill="#F4F2F3"></path><rect x="1.33398" y="9.66797" width="2.33333" height="3.16667" rx="1.16667" stroke="#F4F2F3"></rect><path d="M9.99935 5.83333V2.5H6.66602" stroke="#F4F2F3"></path></svg></div><div class="n-button_text">Agents</div></div><div class="n-button is-transparent-75"><div class="n-button_icon is-20p"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none"><path d="M10.8333 1.66797L2.5 11.668H10L9.16667 18.3346L17.5 8.33464H10L10.8333 1.66797Z" stroke="#161616" stroke-linecap="square" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></div><div class="n-button_text">Models</div></div><div class="n-button is-transparent-75"><div class="n-button_icon is-20p"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none"><g clip-path="url(#clip0_516_2256)"><path d="M15.0007 3.33203H5.00065C4.08018 3.33203 3.33398 4.07822 3.33398 4.9987V14.9987C3.33398 15.9192 4.08018 16.6654 5.00065 16.6654H15.0007C15.9211 16.6654 16.6673 15.9192 16.6673 14.9987V4.9987C16.6673 4.07822 15.9211 3.33203 15.0007 3.33203Z" stroke="#161616" stroke-linecap="square" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M12.5 7.5H7.5V12.5H12.5V7.5Z" stroke="#161616" stroke-linecap="square" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M7.5 0.832031V3.33203" stroke="#161616" stroke-linecap="square" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M12.5 0.832031V3.33203" stroke="#161616" stroke-linecap="square" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M7.5 16.668V19.168" stroke="#161616" stroke-linecap="square" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M12.5 16.668V19.168" stroke="#161616" stroke-linecap="square" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M16.666 7.5H19.166" stroke="#161616" stroke-linecap="square" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M16.666 11.668H19.166" stroke="#161616" stroke-linecap="square" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M0.833984 7.5H3.33398" stroke="#161616" stroke-linecap="square" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M0.833984 11.668H3.33398" stroke="#161616" stroke-linecap="square" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></g><defs><clippath id="clip0_516_2256"><rect width="20" height="20" fill="white"></rect></clippath></defs></svg></div><div class="n-button_text">Applications</div></div><div class="n-button is-transparent-75"><div class="n-button_icon is-20p"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none"><path d="M5 2.5V12.5" stroke="#161616" stroke-linecap="square" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M15 7.5C16.3807 7.5 17.5 6.38071 17.5 5C17.5 3.61929 16.3807 2.5 15 2.5C13.6193 2.5 12.5 3.61929 12.5 5C12.5 6.38071 13.6193 7.5 15 7.5Z" stroke="#161616" stroke-linecap="square" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M5 17.5C6.38071 17.5 7.5 16.3807 7.5 15C7.5 13.6193 6.38071 12.5 5 12.5C3.61929 12.5 2.5 13.6193 2.5 15C2.5 16.3807 3.61929 17.5 5 17.5Z" stroke="#161616" stroke-linecap="square" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M15 7.5C15 9.48912 14.2098 11.3968 12.8033 12.8033C11.3968 14.2098 9.48912 15 7.5 15" stroke="#161616" stroke-linecap="square" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></div><div class="n-button_text">Workflows</div></div></div></div><div class="home-standard_supported-systems"><div class="n-text-size-tiny opacity-50">Policy packs for every major regulatory framework</div><div class="div-block-152"><div class="n-button is-frameworks"><div class="n-button_icon is-20p"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none"><path d="M10.0007 18.3346C10.0007 18.3346 16.6673 15.0013 16.6673 10.0013V4.16797L10.0007 1.66797L3.33398 4.16797V10.0013C3.33398 15.0013 10.0007 18.3346 10.0007 18.3346Z" stroke="#161616" stroke-linecap="square" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></div><div class="n-button_text">EU AI Act</div></div><div class="n-button is-frameworks"><div class="n-button_icon is-20p"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none"><path d="M10.0007 18.3346C10.0007 18.3346 16.6673 15.0013 16.6673 10.0013V4.16797L10.0007 1.66797L3.33398 4.16797V10.0013C3.33398 15.0013 10.0007 18.3346 10.0007 18.3346Z" stroke="#161616" stroke-linecap="square" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></div><div class="n-button_text">NIST AI RMF</div></div><div class="n-button is-frameworks"><div class="n-button_icon is-20p"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none"><path d="M10.0007 18.3346C10.0007 18.3346 16.6673 15.0013 16.6673 10.0013V4.16797L10.0007 1.66797L3.33398 4.16797V10.0013C3.33398 15.0013 10.0007 18.3346 10.0007 18.3346Z" stroke="#161616" stroke-linecap="square" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></div><div class="n-button_text">ISO-42001</div></div><div class="n-button is-frameworks"><div class="n-button_icon is-20p"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none"><path d="M10.0007 18.3346C10.0007 18.3346 16.6673 15.0013 16.6673 10.0013V4.16797L10.0007 1.66797L3.33398 4.16797V10.0013C3.33398 15.0013 10.0007 18.3346 10.0007 18.3346Z" stroke="#161616" stroke-linecap="square" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></div><div class="n-button_text">OMB M-25</div></div><div class="n-button is-frameworks"><div class="n-button_icon is-20p"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none"><path d="M10.0007 18.3346C10.0007 18.3346 16.6673 15.0013 16.6673 10.0013V4.16797L10.0007 1.66797L3.33398 4.16797V10.0013C3.33398 15.0013 10.0007 18.3346 10.0007 18.3346Z" stroke="#161616" stroke-linecap="square" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></div><div class="n-button_text">CO ADMT</div></div><div class="n-button is-frameworks"><div class="n-button_icon is-20p"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none"><path d="M10.0007 18.3346C10.0007 18.3346 16.6673 15.0013 16.6673 10.0013V4.16797L10.0007 1.66797L3.33398 4.16797V10.0013C3.33398 15.0013 10.0007 18.3346 10.0007 18.3346Z" stroke="#161616" stroke-linecap="square" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></div><div class="n-button_text">NAIC AI</div></div></div></div></div><div class="div-block-204"><div class="code-embed-5 video-code-embed w-embed"><video width="100%" height="100%" playsInline autoPlay muted loop class="embed-home-video"  autoplay="true">
  <source src="https://s3.amazonaws.com/webflow-prod-assets/649d808ba8385965c74d94df/699d1af9c3932bd78b21f097_Home%20Page_02%20-%20Credo%20AI%20Governance%20Circle%20Build-webm-final.webm" type="video/webm"/>
</video></div></div></div></div><div class="home-platform n-section"><div class="n-container is-home-platform"><div class="section-head"><div class="gradient-chip_wrapper"><div class="gradient-chip_content"><div>Platform</div></div></div><h2 class="n-section-title">One Platform to Govern Every AI Entity</h2><p class="section-subtitle">Agents, applications, models, and vendors from pilot to production – with native integrations across your existing stack. And with GAIA (Govern AI Assistant), generally available in the platform today, weeks of governance work compress into hours. </p></div><div class="home-platform_integrations"><div class="opacity-50">Integrates With:</div><div class="vertical-divider"></div><div>Snowflake</div><div class="vertical-divider"></div><div>Databricks</div><div class="vertical-divider"></div><div>AWS</div><div class="vertical-divider"></div><div>Azure</div><div class="vertical-divider"></div><div>ServiceNow</div><div class="vertical-divider"></div><div>Jira</div><div class="vertical-divider"></div><div>Confluence</div><div class="vertical-divider"></div><div>Slack</div><div class="vertical-divider"></div><div>GitHub</div><div class="vertical-divider"></div><div>MLflow</div></div><div class="home-platform_features"><div class="home-feature-card"><div class="home-feature-card_image-wrapper"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/649d808ba8385965c74d94df/699cbd8fbe6b885d2359e114_Home%20Page_03%20-%20AI%20RegistryBuild.gif" loading="lazy" alt="" class="home-feature-card_img"/></div><div class="home-feature-card_title"><div class="home-feature-card_icon-wrapper"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/649d808ba8385965c74d94df/698fb1d76c1069846afef0a2_icon_eye.png" loading="lazy" alt="" class="home-feature-card_icon"/></div><h3 class="h3-style is-small">AI Registry</h3></div><p class="opacity-75">Discover and catalog every AI system, agent, vendor and model. Full visibility into shadow AI.</p><ul role="list" class="opacity-75"><li>Agent Registry &amp; Agent Cards<br/></li><li>Shadow AI detection</li><li>Risk Classification</li><li>Dependency mapping</li></ul></div><div class="home-feature-card"><div class="home-feature-card_image-wrapper"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/649d808ba8385965c74d94df/699cbd907589da6ed6447abf_Home%20Page_04%20-%20Risk%20Intel%20Build.gif" loading="lazy" alt="" class="home-feature-card_img"/></div><div class="home-feature-card_title"><div class="home-feature-card_icon-wrapper"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/649d808ba8385965c74d94df/698fb1d9317dbb9f17b613b4_icon_shield.png" loading="lazy" alt="" class="home-feature-card_icon"/></div><h3 class="h3-style is-small">Risk Intelligence</h3></div><p class="opacity-75">Continuous, contextual risk assessment, including a purpose-built agentic risk and control library for tool misuse, scope drift, and inter-agent risk.</p><ul role="list" class="opacity-75"><li>Agentic risk &amp; control library<br/></li><li>Continuous monitoring, drift detection and real-time alerts by connecting to your observability and monitoring tools</li></ul></div><div class="home-feature-card"><div class="home-feature-card_image-wrapper"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/649d808ba8385965c74d94df/699cbd8ffe8eee11dcd0a8b5_Home%20Page_05%20-%20Policy%20Build.gif" loading="lazy" alt="" class="home-feature-card_img"/></div><div class="home-feature-card_title"><div class="home-feature-card_icon-wrapper"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/649d808ba8385965c74d94df/698fb1d79972b00aa2aab172_icon_add-document.png" loading="lazy" alt="" class="home-feature-card_icon"/></div><h3 class="h3-style is-small">Policy Engine</h3></div><p class="opacity-75">Turn policy into code: pre-built policy packs with regulatory intelligence, automated workflows, and audit-ready evidence – for AI and for agents. </p><ul role="list" class="opacity-75"><li>Policy-to-code translation<br/></li><li>Pre-built policy packs</li><li>Compliance mapping</li><li>Evidence recording and audit</li></ul></div></div></div></div><div class="home-why-us n-section"><div class="n-container"><div class="section-head"><div class="section-chip">Why Credo AI</div><h2 class="n-section-title">Purpose-Built for AI Governance</h2><p class="section-subtitle">We didn&#x27;t bolt AI features onto a GRC tool. We built the platform for Measurable Trust from scratch – and it shows. </p></div><div class="why-us"><div class="why-us_image"><div class="code-embed-5 video-code-embed w-embed"><video width="100%" playsInline autoPlay muted loop class="embed-home-video" height="100%" autoplay="true">
  <source src="https://s3.amazonaws.com/webflow-prod-assets/649d808ba8385965c74d94df/699d1c07a907c3b3094b5048_Home%20Page_07%20-%20The%20Why%20-%20Governance%20Build-webm-final.webm" type="video/webm"/>
</video></div><div class="text-block-38">Continuous governance loop — AI systems are assessed, governed, and monitored in an infinite cycle.</div></div><div class="why-us_cards"><div class="why-us_card"><div class="div-block-155"><div class="div-block-153"><div class="why-us_card-step main-gradient-bg"></div><div class="why-us_card-step"></div><div class="why-us_card-step"></div><div class="why-us_card-step"></div></div><div class="div-block-154"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 64 64" fill="none" class="svg-icon"><path d="M31.9994 8.66797L8.66602 20.3346L31.9994 32.0013L55.3327 20.3346L31.9994 8.66797Z" stroke="#161616" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="square" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M8.66602 43.668L31.9994 55.3346L55.3327 43.668" stroke="#161616" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="square" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M8.66602 32L31.9994 43.6667L55.3327 32" stroke="#161616" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="square" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></div><h3 class="h3-style">The Only Pure-Play Platform Governing Every Layer, Including Agents</h3></div><div class="div-block-157"><div class="div-block-156"><div class="text-weight-semibold">Credo AI</div><p class="n-text-size-small">Model-level, application-level, and agent-level governance in one platform – with agents as first-class governed entities: registered, risk-assessed, sanctioned, and governed.</p></div><div><div class="text-weight-semibold chin-black-50">Alternatives</div><p class="n-text-size-small chin-black-50">Security tools watch agents but can&#x27;t sanction them. GRC tools document AI but can&#x27;t see agents at all.</p></div></div></div><div class="why-us_card"><div class="div-block-155"><div class="div-block-153"><div class="why-us_card-step"></div><div class="why-us_card-step main-gradient-bg"></div><div class="why-us_card-step"></div><div class="why-us_card-step"></div></div><div class="div-block-154"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 64 64" fill="none" class="svg-icon"><path d="M6.33398 13.332V27.332H20.334" stroke="#161616" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="square" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M57.666 50.668V36.668H43.666" stroke="#161616" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="square" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M51.8107 24.9984C50.6273 21.6542 48.616 18.6643 45.9646 16.3077C43.3131 13.9511 40.1079 12.3045 36.648 11.5217C33.1881 10.7388 29.5862 10.8452 26.1785 11.8309C22.7709 12.8165 19.6684 14.6494 17.1607 17.1584L6.33398 27.3317M57.6673 36.6651L46.8407 46.8384C44.3329 49.3474 41.2304 51.1802 37.8228 52.1659C34.4151 53.1516 30.8132 53.258 27.3533 52.4751C23.8934 51.6923 20.6882 50.0457 18.0367 47.6891C15.3853 45.3324 13.374 42.3426 12.1907 38.9984" stroke="#161616" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="square" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></div><h3 class="h3-style">Continuous, Not Point-in-Time</h3></div><div class="div-block-157"><div class="div-block-156"><div class="text-weight-semibold">Credo AI</div><p class="n-text-size-small">Governance across the entire lifecycle – design, development, and production – with evidence flowing back through your monitoring and security stack. You cannot govern millisecond decisions with a monthly audit. We don&#x27;t. </p></div><div><div class="text-weight-semibold chin-black-50">Alternatives</div><p class="n-text-size-small chin-black-50">Snapshot compliance – already outdated by deployment. </p></div></div></div><div class="why-us_card"><div class="div-block-155"><div class="div-block-153"><div class="why-us_card-step"></div><div class="why-us_card-step"></div><div class="why-us_card-step main-gradient-bg"></div><div class="why-us_card-step"></div></div><div class="div-block-154"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 64 64" fill="none" class="svg-icon"><path d="M53.0006 8.66797L48.334 13.3346M48.334 13.3346L55.334 20.3346L47.1673 28.5013L40.1673 21.5013M48.334 13.3346L40.1673 21.5013M30.5773 31.0913C31.7821 32.2801 32.7398 33.6954 33.3954 35.2558C34.051 36.8162 34.3914 38.4909 34.397 40.1834C34.4027 41.876 34.0735 43.5529 33.4284 45.1177C32.7834 46.6825 31.8351 48.1042 30.6383 49.301C29.4415 50.4978 28.0198 51.446 26.455 52.0911C24.8902 52.7362 23.2133 53.0654 21.5208 53.0597C19.8283 53.054 18.1536 52.7136 16.5932 52.0581C15.0327 51.4025 13.6174 50.4448 12.4286 49.24C10.0909 46.8196 8.79742 43.5778 8.82666 40.213C8.8559 36.8481 10.2056 33.6294 12.585 31.25C14.9644 28.8706 18.1831 27.5209 21.548 27.4917C24.9129 27.4624 28.1546 28.7559 30.575 31.0936L30.5773 31.0913ZM30.5773 31.0913L40.1673 21.5013" stroke="#161616" stroke-width="2.33333" stroke-linecap="square" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></div><h3 class="h3-style">Contextual: A Governance Knowledge Graph That Knows Your Business</h3></div><div class="div-block-157"><div class="div-block-156"><div class="text-weight-semibold">Credo AI</div><p class="n-text-size-small">World governance intelligence – regulations, third-party risk, model trust scores – built and updated by agents, validated by human experts, and fused with your business context from 300+ integrations and forward-deployed governance experts. A claims agent in EU insurance gets different controls than a marketing agent in US retail. Automatically.  </p></div><div><div class="text-weight-semibold chin-black-50">Alternatives</div><p class="n-text-size-small chin-black-50">Generic checklists with no awareness of your context.</p></div></div></div><div class="why-us_card"><div class="div-block-155"><div class="div-block-153"><div class="why-us_card-step"></div><div class="why-us_card-step"></div><div class="why-us_card-step"></div><div class="why-us_card-step main-gradient-bg"></div></div><div class="div-block-154"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 64 64" fill="none" class="svg-icon"><path d="M48.3333 29.668H15.6667C13.0893 29.668 11 31.7573 11 34.3346V50.668C11 53.2453 13.0893 55.3346 15.6667 55.3346H48.3333C50.9107 55.3346 53 53.2453 53 50.668V34.3346C53 31.7573 50.9107 29.668 48.3333 29.668Z" stroke="#161616" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="square" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M20.334 29.668V20.3346C20.334 17.2404 21.5631 14.273 23.7511 12.0851C25.939 9.89713 28.9065 8.66797 32.0007 8.66797C35.0948 8.66797 38.0623 9.89713 40.2502 12.0851C42.4382 14.273 43.6673 17.2404 43.6673 20.3346V29.668" stroke="#161616" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="square" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></div><h3 class="h3-style">Six Years of Regulatory Authority, Out of the Box</h3></div><div class="div-block-157"><div class="div-block-156"><div class="text-weight-semibold">Credo AI</div><p class="n-text-size-small">Ready-to-deploy policy packs for EU AI Act, NIST AI RMF, ISO 42001, and beyond — written by the team in the room where AI governance standards are made: ISO, NIST, the EU Parliament, NATO, OECD.</p></div><div><div class="text-weight-semibold chin-black-50">Alternatives</div><p class="n-text-size-small chin-black-50">Manual policy mapping, months of work.</p></div></div></div></div></div><div class="buttons-wrapper is-centered"><a href="/get-started" class="n-button w-inline-block"><div class="n-button_text">See Credo AI in Action</div><div class="n-button_icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" class="svg-icon"><rect width="24" height="24" rx="12" fill="white"></rect><path d="M7.33398 12H16.6673" stroke="#161616" stroke-linecap="square" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M12 7.33203L16.6667 11.9987L12 16.6654" stroke="#161616" stroke-linecap="square" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></div></a></div></div></div><div class="home-testimonials n-section"><div class="n-container"><div class="section-head"><h2 class="n-section-title">Recognized for Our Pioneering Work in AI Governance</h2><p class="section-subtitle">One platform to govern every AI system — from pilot to production — with native integrations across your existing stack.</p></div><div class="case-studies-swiper"><div class="case-studies-swiper_wrapper"><div class="case-studies-swiper_slide"><div class="case-studies-swiper_content"><img sizes="100vw" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/649d808ba8385965c74d94df/698fb1d9bafa13418b97a895_logo_mastercard-p-500.png 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/649d808ba8385965c74d94df/698fb1d9bafa13418b97a895_logo_mastercard.png 528w" alt="" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/649d808ba8385965c74d94df/698fb1d9bafa13418b97a895_logo_mastercard.png" loading="lazy" class="image-33"/><div class="div-block-165"><div class="mentions-quote">&quot;Using the Credo AI Platform, Mastercard is able to manage AI risk and responsibly implement generative AI – with better speed and scale than ever before.&quot;<br/></div><div><div class="text-block-39">Chief Data Scientist</div><div class="text-block-40">AdeptID</div></div></div></div><div class="case-studies-swiper_content-stats"><div class="div-block-166"><a href="#" class="n-button is-secondary w-inline-block"><div class="n-button_text">Read More</div><div class="n-button_icon is-secondary"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" class="svg-icon"><path d="M3.33398 8H12.6673" stroke="#161616" stroke-linecap="square" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M8 3.33203L12.6667 7.9987L8 12.6654" stroke="#161616" stroke-linecap="square" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></div></a></div><div class="div-block-167"><div class="text-block-41">143B+</div><div class="text-block-42">Transactions Protected</div></div></div></div><div class="case-studies-swiper_slide"><div class="case-studies-swiper_content"><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/649d808ba8385965c74d94df/687817aee622cff0dbf72146_sponsor-microsoft.png" alt="" class="image-33"/><div class="div-block-165"><div class="mentions-quote">“Credo AI’s integration tackles one of the biggest blockers in enterprise AI–the communication and alignment gap between AI governance teams and developers.”<br/></div><div><div class="text-block-39">Chief Data Scientist</div><div class="text-block-40">AdeptID</div></div></div></div><div class="case-studies-swiper_content-stats"><div class="div-block-166"><a href="#" class="n-button is-secondary w-inline-block"><div class="n-button_text">Read More</div><div class="n-button_icon is-secondary"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" class="svg-icon"><path d="M3.33398 8H12.6673" stroke="#161616" stroke-linecap="square" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M8 3.33203L12.6667 7.9987L8 12.6654" stroke="#161616" stroke-linecap="square" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></div></a></div><div class="div-block-167"><div class="text-block-41">143B+</div><div class="text-block-42">Transactions Protected</div></div></div></div><div class="case-studies-swiper_slide"><div class="case-studies-swiper_content"><img sizes="100vw" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/649d808ba8385965c74d94df/698fb1d9bafa13418b97a895_logo_mastercard-p-500.png 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/649d808ba8385965c74d94df/698fb1d9bafa13418b97a895_logo_mastercard.png 528w" alt="" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/649d808ba8385965c74d94df/698fb1d9bafa13418b97a895_logo_mastercard.png" loading="lazy" class="image-33"/><div class="div-block-165"><div class="mentions-quote">&quot;Working with the Credo AI platform accelerated our ability to be compliant with the EU AI Act by at least 10x the speed of trying to do it manually.&quot;</div><div><div class="text-block-39">Chief Data Scientist</div><div class="text-block-40">AdeptID</div></div></div></div><div class="case-studies-swiper_content-stats"><div class="div-block-166"><a href="#" class="n-button is-secondary w-inline-block"><div class="n-button_text">Read More</div><div class="n-button_icon is-secondary"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" class="svg-icon"><path d="M3.33398 8H12.6673" stroke="#161616" stroke-linecap="square" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M8 3.33203L12.6667 7.9987L8 12.6654" stroke="#161616" stroke-linecap="square" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></div></a></div><div class="div-block-167"><div class="text-block-41">143B+</div><div class="text-block-42">Transactions Protected</div></div></div></div></div><div class="swiper_nav"><div swiper-prev="" class="swiper_nav-button"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" class="svg-icon"><path d="M12.666 8H3.33268" stroke="#161616" stroke-linecap="square" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M8 3.33203L3.33333 7.9987L8 12.6654" stroke="#161616" stroke-linecap="square" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></div><div class="swiper_pagination"><div class="swiper_pagination-bullet is-active"></div><div class="swiper_pagination-bullet"></div></div><div swiper-next="" class="swiper_nav-button"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" class="svg-icon is-flipped"><path d="M12.666 8H3.33268" stroke="#161616" stroke-linecap="square" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M8 3.33203L3.33333 7.9987L8 12.6654" stroke="#161616" stroke-linecap="square" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></div></div></div><div class="advisory_experts_swiper"><div class="advisory_experts_swiper-wrapper"><div class="advisory_experts_swiper-slide is-new"><div class="advisory_experts_swiper-slide-inner is-microsoft"><div class="advisory_experts_swiper-mobile-image"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/649d808ba8385965c74d94df/699d0a0009ba62eca7d247db_advisory_card_adept-id.jpg" loading="lazy" sizes="100vw" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/649d808ba8385965c74d94df/699d0a0009ba62eca7d247db_advisory_card_adept-id-p-500.jpg 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/649d808ba8385965c74d94df/699d0a0009ba62eca7d247db_advisory_card_adept-id-p-800.jpg 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/649d808ba8385965c74d94df/699d0a0009ba62eca7d247db_advisory_card_adept-id-p-1080.jpg 1080w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/649d808ba8385965c74d94df/699d0a0009ba62eca7d247db_advisory_card_adept-id.jpg 1528w" alt="" class="full-image"/><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/649d808ba8385965c74d94df/687817aee622cff0dbf72146_sponsor-microsoft.png" loading="lazy" alt="" class="advisory_experts_swiper-logo is-mobile"/><div class="testimonial-gradient-overlay"></div></div><div class="advisory-experts_swiper-slide-content"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/649d808ba8385965c74d94df/687817aee622cff0dbf72146_sponsor-microsoft.png" loading="lazy" alt="" class="advisory_experts_swiper-logo"/><p class="advisory_experts_swiper-quote">“Credo AI’s integration tackles one of the biggest blockers in enterprise AI–the communication and alignment gap between AI governance teams and developers. The integration delivers prescriptive guidance to AI governance leaders on what to evaluate and empowers developers to run governance-aligned evaluations directly within their workflow.”</p><div><strong>Sarah Bird<br/></strong>Chief Product Officer for Responsible AI</div></div></div></div><div class="advisory_experts_swiper-slide is-new"><div class="advisory_experts_swiper-slide-inner is-mastercard"><div class="advisory_experts_swiper-mobile-image"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/649d808ba8385965c74d94df/699d0932420cb95d3e675b70_advisory_card_bg_mastercard.jpg" loading="lazy" sizes="100vw" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/649d808ba8385965c74d94df/699d0932420cb95d3e675b70_advisory_card_bg_mastercard-p-500.jpg 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/649d808ba8385965c74d94df/699d0932420cb95d3e675b70_advisory_card_bg_mastercard-p-800.jpg 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/649d808ba8385965c74d94df/699d0932420cb95d3e675b70_advisory_card_bg_mastercard-p-1080.jpg 1080w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/649d808ba8385965c74d94df/699d0932420cb95d3e675b70_advisory_card_bg_mastercard.jpg 1528w" alt="" class="full-image"/><div class="testimonial-gradient-overlay"></div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/649d808ba8385965c74d94df/698fb1d9bafa13418b97a895_logo_mastercard.png" loading="lazy" sizes="100vw" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/649d808ba8385965c74d94df/698fb1d9bafa13418b97a895_logo_mastercard-p-500.png 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/649d808ba8385965c74d94df/698fb1d9bafa13418b97a895_logo_mastercard.png 528w" alt="" class="advisory_experts_swiper-logo is-mobile"/></div><div class="advisory-experts_swiper-slide-content"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/649d808ba8385965c74d94df/698fb1d9bafa13418b97a895_logo_mastercard.png" loading="lazy" sizes="100vw" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/649d808ba8385965c74d94df/698fb1d9bafa13418b97a895_logo_mastercard-p-500.png 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/649d808ba8385965c74d94df/698fb1d9bafa13418b97a895_logo_mastercard.png 528w" alt="" class="advisory_experts_swiper-logo"/><p class="advisory_experts_swiper-quote">&quot;Using the Credo AI Platform, Mastercard is able to manage AI risk and responsibly implement generative AI – with better speed and scale than ever before. Features like AI Registry and Vendor Registry have allowed us to maintain control of all AI use cases, to ensure all of our AI at Mastercard aligns to our governance frameworks and principles.&quot;</p><div><strong>Andrew Reiskind<br/></strong>Chief Data Officer at Mastercard</div></div></div></div><div class="advisory_experts_swiper-slide is-new"><div class="advisory_experts_swiper-slide-inner is-adept"><div class="advisory_experts_swiper-mobile-image"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/649d808ba8385965c74d94df/699d0b06bb108884319d9ed2_advisory_card_adept-id.jpg" loading="lazy" sizes="100vw" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/649d808ba8385965c74d94df/699d0b06bb108884319d9ed2_advisory_card_adept-id-p-500.jpg 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/649d808ba8385965c74d94df/699d0b06bb108884319d9ed2_advisory_card_adept-id-p-800.jpg 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/649d808ba8385965c74d94df/699d0b06bb108884319d9ed2_advisory_card_adept-id-p-1080.jpg 1080w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/649d808ba8385965c74d94df/699d0b06bb108884319d9ed2_advisory_card_adept-id.jpg 1528w" alt="" class="full-image"/><div class="testimonial-gradient-overlay"></div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/649d808ba8385965c74d94df/66152562b7bb6752c9d64fe8_adeptid.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="advisory_experts_swiper-logo is-mobile is-inverted"/></div><div class="advisory-experts_swiper-slide-content"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/649d808ba8385965c74d94df/66152562b7bb6752c9d64fe8_adeptid.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="advisory_experts_swiper-logo is-inverted"/><p class="advisory_experts_swiper-quote">&quot;Through our partnership with Credo AI we get this amazing centralized platform that helps us keep up with annual technical audits. It also gives us this opportunity to get amazing feedback from industry experts at Credo AI on the work we’ve been doing... This is super helpful when planning our development cycles.&quot;</p><div><strong>Kathleen Cachel<br/></strong>Senior Data Scientist</div></div></div></div><div class="advisory_experts_swiper-slide is-new"><div class="advisory_experts_swiper-slide-inner"><div class="advisory_experts_swiper-mobile-image"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/649d808ba8385965c74d94df/688cf178761abd8fbc3b29f6_advisory_card_bg_01.jpg" loading="lazy" sizes="100vw" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/649d808ba8385965c74d94df/688cf178761abd8fbc3b29f6_advisory_card_bg_01-p-500.jpg 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/649d808ba8385965c74d94df/688cf178761abd8fbc3b29f6_advisory_card_bg_01-p-800.jpg 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/649d808ba8385965c74d94df/688cf178761abd8fbc3b29f6_advisory_card_bg_01-p-1080.jpg 1080w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/649d808ba8385965c74d94df/688cf178761abd8fbc3b29f6_advisory_card_bg_01.jpg 1460w" alt="" class="full-image"/><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/649d808ba8385965c74d94df/688cf1771566172381f56609_madrigal.png" loading="lazy" alt="" class="advisory_experts_swiper-logo is-mobile"/></div><div class="advisory-experts_swiper-slide-content"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/649d808ba8385965c74d94df/688cf1771566172381f56609_madrigal.png" loading="lazy" alt="" class="advisory_experts_swiper-logo"/><p class="advisory_experts_swiper-quote">&quot;Credo AI’s framework has complemented our internal efforts—helping us enhance existing processes, reinforce risk management, and align stakeholders around a governance model that can scale with our AI adoption.&quot;</p><div><strong>Parth Patel<br/></strong>Executive Director, AI and Data Science</div></div></div></div><div class="advisory_experts_swiper-slide is-new"><div class="advisory_experts_swiper-slide-inner is-sixth"><div class="advisory_experts_swiper-mobile-image"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/649d808ba8385965c74d94df/6898e4759f53ea0e9c850d88_BG.png" loading="lazy" sizes="100vw" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/649d808ba8385965c74d94df/6898e4759f53ea0e9c850d88_BG-p-500.png 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/649d808ba8385965c74d94df/6898e4759f53ea0e9c850d88_BG.png 702w" alt="" class="full-image"/><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/649d808ba8385965c74d94df/6898e4a21ed3a3aba89d7766_Principal.png" loading="lazy" alt="" class="advisory_experts_swiper-logo is-mobile"/></div><div class="advisory-experts_swiper-slide-content"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/649d808ba8385965c74d94df/6898e4a21ed3a3aba89d7766_Principal.png" loading="lazy" alt="" class="advisory_experts_swiper-logo"/><p class="advisory_experts_swiper-quote">“Credo AI helped us rapidly stand up an enterprise-ready AI governance workflow—aligned with our stakeholders, grounded in risk, and built for scale.&quot;</p><div><span><strong>Renee Langeness</strong></span><br/>Director of Data Governance at Principal®</div></div></div></div><div class="advisory_experts_swiper-slide is-new"><div class="advisory_experts_swiper-slide-inner is-second"><div class="advisory_experts_swiper-mobile-image"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/649d808ba8385965c74d94df/688cf178390caf4ef9e1f4ba_advisory_card_bg_02.jpg" loading="lazy" sizes="100vw" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/649d808ba8385965c74d94df/688cf178390caf4ef9e1f4ba_advisory_card_bg_02-p-500.jpg 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/649d808ba8385965c74d94df/688cf178390caf4ef9e1f4ba_advisory_card_bg_02-p-800.jpg 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/649d808ba8385965c74d94df/688cf178390caf4ef9e1f4ba_advisory_card_bg_02-p-1080.jpg 1080w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/649d808ba8385965c74d94df/688cf178390caf4ef9e1f4ba_advisory_card_bg_02.jpg 1460w" alt="" class="full-image"/><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/649d808ba8385965c74d94df/688bf8973b95a36311a2fc78_version.png" loading="lazy" alt="" class="advisory_experts_swiper-logo is-mobile"/></div><div class="advisory-experts_swiper-slide-content"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/649d808ba8385965c74d94df/688bf8973b95a36311a2fc78_version.png" loading="lazy" alt="" class="advisory_experts_swiper-logo"/><p class="advisory_experts_swiper-quote">&quot;We&#x27;re using Credo AI internally to control dozens of ongoing projects, whether they&#x27;re client facing projects or solutions, but for us as an organization, we&#x27;re also making sure we&#x27;re compliant first and foremost with our own policies but also the EU AI Act.&quot;</p><div><strong>Brad Mallard<br/></strong>CTO</div></div></div></div><div class="advisory_experts_swiper-slide is-new"><div class="advisory_experts_swiper-slide-inner is-third"><div class="advisory_experts_swiper-mobile-image"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/649d808ba8385965c74d94df/688cf178a6cd281e3c1d114b_advisory_card_bg_03.jpg" loading="lazy" sizes="100vw" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/649d808ba8385965c74d94df/688cf178a6cd281e3c1d114b_advisory_card_bg_03-p-500.jpg 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/649d808ba8385965c74d94df/688cf178a6cd281e3c1d114b_advisory_card_bg_03-p-800.jpg 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/649d808ba8385965c74d94df/688cf178a6cd281e3c1d114b_advisory_card_bg_03-p-1080.jpg 1080w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/649d808ba8385965c74d94df/688cf178a6cd281e3c1d114b_advisory_card_bg_03.jpg 1528w" alt="" class="full-image"/><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/649d808ba8385965c74d94df/688bf973833a9e45ff12bfaf_ibm.png" loading="lazy" alt="" class="advisory_experts_swiper-logo is-mobile"/></div><div class="advisory-experts_swiper-slide-content"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/649d808ba8385965c74d94df/688bf973833a9e45ff12bfaf_ibm.png" loading="lazy" alt="" class="advisory_experts_swiper-logo"/><p class="advisory_experts_swiper-quote">“IBM’s collaboration with Credo AI on Compliance Accelerators advances this goal, pooling expertise across organizations to fuel more responsible, transparent, and explainable AI&quot;</p><div><strong>Heather Gentile</strong><br/>Director of Product</div></div></div></div><div class="advisory_experts_swiper-slide is-new"><div class="advisory_experts_swiper-slide-inner is-fourth"><div class="advisory_experts_swiper-mobile-image"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/649d808ba8385965c74d94df/688cf3d4eca448d4ebf029a9_advisory_card_bg_04.jpg" loading="lazy" sizes="100vw" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/649d808ba8385965c74d94df/688cf3d4eca448d4ebf029a9_advisory_card_bg_04-p-500.jpg 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/649d808ba8385965c74d94df/688cf3d4eca448d4ebf029a9_advisory_card_bg_04-p-800.jpg 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/649d808ba8385965c74d94df/688cf3d4eca448d4ebf029a9_advisory_card_bg_04-p-1080.jpg 1080w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/649d808ba8385965c74d94df/688cf3d4eca448d4ebf029a9_advisory_card_bg_04.jpg 1528w" alt="" class="full-image"/><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/649d808ba8385965c74d94df/688c01875205fe9140539459_mckinsey.png" loading="lazy" alt="" class="advisory_experts_swiper-logo is-mobile"/></div><div class="advisory-experts_swiper-slide-content"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/649d808ba8385965c74d94df/688c01875205fe9140539459_mckinsey.png" loading="lazy" alt="" class="advisory_experts_swiper-logo"/><p class="advisory_experts_swiper-quote">&quot;What we saw with Credo AI was that 100% focus on helping raise the bar on enterprise [AI] trust, and create something that can be the platform for enterprises to truly work their way up the platform of maturity.&quot;</p><div><strong>Roger Roberts<br/></strong>Principal, Digital Technology</div></div></div></div><div class="advisory_experts_swiper-slide is-new"><div class="advisory_experts_swiper-slide-inner is-fifth"><div class="advisory_experts_swiper-mobile-image"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/649d808ba8385965c74d94df/6893a25f3cd8237bee0552ea_microsoftbg.png" loading="lazy" sizes="100vw" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/649d808ba8385965c74d94df/6893a25f3cd8237bee0552ea_microsoftbg-p-500.png 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/649d808ba8385965c74d94df/6893a25f3cd8237bee0552ea_microsoftbg.png 702w" alt="" class="full-image"/><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/649d808ba8385965c74d94df/687817aee622cff0dbf72146_sponsor-microsoft.png" loading="lazy" alt="" class="advisory_experts_swiper-logo is-mobile"/></div><div class="advisory-experts_swiper-slide-content"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/649d808ba8385965c74d94df/687817aee622cff0dbf72146_sponsor-microsoft.png" loading="lazy" alt="" class="advisory_experts_swiper-logo"/><p class="advisory_experts_swiper-quote">&quot;Through Credo AI we get access to the world&#x27;s largest risk library, and the best mapping I&#x27;ve ever seen of all the risks they need to pay attention to, based on the area, region, the base model they&#x27;re using, all to way to exactly what needs to be measured.&quot;</p><div><strong>Mehrnoosh Sameki<br/></strong>Principal PM Manager, Generative AI Evaluation and Governance</div></div></div></div></div><div class="swiper_nav is-margin-top"><div swiper-prev="" class="swiper_nav-button"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" class="svg-icon"><path d="M12.666 8H3.33268" stroke="#161616" stroke-linecap="square" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M8 3.33203L3.33333 7.9987L8 12.6654" stroke="#161616" stroke-linecap="square" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></div><div class="swiper_pagination"><div class="swiper_pagination-bullet is-active"></div><div class="swiper_pagination-bullet"></div></div><div swiper-next="" class="swiper_nav-button"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" class="svg-icon is-flipped"><path d="M12.666 8H3.33268" stroke="#161616" stroke-linecap="square" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M8 3.33203L3.33333 7.9987L8 12.6654" stroke="#161616" stroke-linecap="square" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></div></div></div><div class="buttons-wrapper is-centered"><a href="/customers" class="n-button w-inline-block"><div class="n-button_text">Explore Case Studies</div><div class="n-button_icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" class="svg-icon"><rect width="24" height="24" rx="12" fill="white"></rect><path d="M7.33398 12H16.6673" stroke="#161616" stroke-linecap="square" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M12 7.33203L16.6667 11.9987L12 16.6654" stroke="#161616" stroke-linecap="square" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></div></a></div></div></div><div class="cta-section n-section"><div clas